<para id="RM000002X34002X" category="C" type-id="802CZ" name-id="950UR-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>U1002</dtccode>
<dtcname>Sub-network Communication Malfunction (Main Body)</dtcname>
<dtccode>U0327</dtccode>
<dtcname>Smart/Certification ECU Not Connected</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002X34002X_02" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000BAY00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU) stores code U0327 when it cannot receive data from the smart key computer assembly (certification ECU).</ptxt>
<ptxt>The instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU) stores code U1002 when it cannot receive data from any of the ECUs it has stored as connected to the MS bus. (The meter ECU is connected as a terminating resistor and does not send or receive data on the MS bus.)</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.34in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.32in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U0327</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Data cannot be received from the certification ECU while IG voltage is normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) branch line open</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor connector contact or contact pressure</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) power source malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>U1002</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Data cannot be received from any of the ECUs on the MS bus side stored as connected in the main body ECU</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>MS bus main line open or short</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) branch line open or short</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor connector terminal contact or contact pressure</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>CAN J/C3</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Smart Key Computer Assembly (Certification ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Main body ECU internal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
